{"id":"n60346-1-5","stage":0,"title":"그럼 · 那么","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60346-1-5-1","ko":"점심을 못 먹어서 배가 고파.","zh":"我还没吃午饭，所以好饿。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"점심을","meaning":"中饭，午饭，午餐","explanation":"점심：中饭，午饭，午餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"점심","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70868","senseId":"1","lemma":"점심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"점심을","audio":"/audio/995779c1209c18f09c54.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（与后面的动词合用）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（完成动作）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"먹어서","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹어서","audio":"/audio/fde9845da352d414d301.mp3"}},{"text":"배가","meaning":"肚子","explanation":"배：肚子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"배","audio":"/audio/3d0af87e12fd988a7b27.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20211","senseId":"1","lemma":"배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배가","audio":"/audio/c5a9b1ff55fc80e6120e.mp3"}},{"text":"고파.","meaning":"饿，饥饿","explanation":"고프다：饿，饥饿；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고프다","audio":"/audio/a55fb1c7a8a68fcb81c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18396","senseId":"1","lemma":"고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고파","audio":"/audio/05512dc16bb4bcd499cb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"12cf30d1ce4feda7","term":"점심","zh":"中饭，午饭，午餐","audio":"/audio/12cf30d1ce4feda7a77d.mp3","entryId":"70868","definition":"早餐和晚餐之间，白天吃的饭。","pronunciation":["점ː심"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107",